{'symbol': 'HON', 'date': '2023-06-22 06:00:00', 'title': 'HONEYWELL PARTNERS WITH FOKKER SERVICES GROUP FOR REPAIR AND OVERHAUL SERVICES', 'text': 'PARIS, JUNE 22, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0HONEYWELL (NASDAQ: HON) AND FOKKER SERVICES B.V. (FOKKER) HAVE SIGNED A MEMORANDUM OF AGREEMENT WHEREBY FOKKER HAS BEEN AUTHORIZED AS A SERVICE CENTER & CHANNEL PARTNER FOR HONEYWELL PRE-COOLER CONTROL VALVE (PCCV) REPAIR AND OVERHAUL SERVICES.'}{'symbol': 'HON', 'date': '2023-06-22 02:00:00', 'title': "HONEYWELL'S ASPIRE 350 SELECTED FOR DASSAULT FALCON FLEET", 'text': "BUSINESS AIRCRAFT OPERATORS AND PILOTS TO BENEFIT FROM IMPROVED CONNECTIVITY PARIS , JUNE 22, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- HONEYWELL'S (NASDAQ: HON) ASPIRE 350\xa0SATELLITE COMMUNICATIONS SYSTEM HAS BEEN SELECTED BY DASSAULT FOR ITS FLEET OF FALCON BUSINESS AIRCRAFT. THE DEAL, ANNOUNCED AT PARIS AIR SHOW 2023, WILL SEE FORWARD FIT AND AFTERMARKET RETROFIT APPLICATIONS OF ASPIRE 350 ON DASSAULT FALCON BUSINESS AIRCRAFT, INCLUDING THE F900, F2000, F7X, F8X, F6X AND F10X."}